  symmetry on every focused mode, not just singleton outputs.

  <section|Continued local grouping and singleton proofs, 11
  November><label|continued-local-grouping-and-singleton-proofs-11-november>

  At source pin 3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464, read the complete
  finite regrouping sources <verbatim|Grouping/{Fibers,Dew,Gush,Sugary,Stained,Ebb,River}>,
