  vacuum retention and covariance; this is separate from analytic projection.
  Independent local conditional passes: grouping hash
  9c04100186186b48f2610b9ac9c7fc940b09a6ad25e0f1fba655d4bb84048211; grouping
  algebra 118058d63807ff051928347e71b539f1e9313852c1f7801807a8b63cda284390;
  cutoff 68eee7274a5ac6780fb898b87752fe80c60ba0ce8088205c88f8e9002a7c325f.
  The cutoff review required the explicit cross-cell separation proof now
  included.

