  <verbatim|North/{Verve,Anise}.lean>, and
  <verbatim|OPE/Replicas/Arbor.lean>. The last confirms arbitrary finite
  slots, not just two per cell. Elementary finite polynomial algebra and
  weighted sums are proved directly; no literature substitution is asserted.
  Shared background README was searched first.

  This discharges singleton extraction after regrouping conditional on the
  precise unused-slot inventory, background validity, and already obtained
  support prices. It does not discharge the analytic local projection or the
  actual transition supplier. Those remain substantive work. No Lean source
  edits/build or renewed axiom replay.

  <section|Shared local transfer and coefficient-field
  consumer><label|shared-local-transfer-and-coefficient-field-consumer>

