  <verbatim|Tongue>, <verbatim|Memo>, <verbatim|Ballad>, plus
  <verbatim|Extra/MULTISOURCE_BOUNDS/Root> (root_hit). The chapter proves the
  occupancy-to-site conversion, finite same-slot compression, T+exp(T)T
  inventory bound, response-closure identity and connected-support bound,
  reweighting and the actual Duty specialization. The stronger reviewer
  requested explicit unweighted-fare definition, integrability hypotheses
  before commuting linear maps with integrals, and component flag
  completeness; all applied. Analytic <verbatim|Volant.reserves> and quote
  operator properties remain displayed inputs.

