  actual +5 Vault(2,1) reference price is separate from centered +6. The
  scale interval is ref(d)\<leqslant\>m\<leqslant\>k\<less\>N and all paths
  use the same N/history; conjugating copies conjugate portfolio
  coefficients. The full mixed join and room-dependent product identity are
  preserved; transfer multiplicativity is not inferred. Independent local
  passes are recorded in reviews/draft-review.md: cone
